WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
Peer evidence gives us reasons to try,
with careful interpretation.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.280
The financial-services cases
report different measures:

00:00:07.328 --> 00:00:11.360
test creation time, selected-module
coverage and major incidents.

00:00:11.504 --> 00:00:14.960
Some outcomes come from wider
modernization rather than AI.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:19.920
Those results cannot be combined into one
savings rate for our banking scenario.

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:22.800
Use the cases to identify
a plausible practice,

00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:27.000
then measure the local baseline,
review effort and quality.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:29.600
Our Banking Client's
outcomes remain unmeasured.
